{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scale the Depths</strong> is a relaxing fishing game. Explore the mysterious depths to catch a variety of fish, prepare them for consumption, and feed them to hungry \u201ccustomers\u201d that swim your way. Upgrade your gear along the way, discover sunken treasure, and encounter legendary sea creatures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure awaits when you plunge into the deep, and <strong>Scale the Depths</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cast Your Line!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch a variety of fish and discover hidden secrets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/083bd732c9e733ac4e6c1a2a51a9e47c.poster.avif?t=1759392903\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/083bd732c9e733ac4e6c1a2a51a9e47c.webm?t=1759392903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/083bd732c9e733ac4e6c1a2a51a9e47c.mp4?t=1759392903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prepare Your Catch!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scale fish just right with precise timing and control. Going too fast may damage the scales!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/d7b70230775262df5590c55a24f51386.poster.avif?t=1759392903\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/d7b70230775262df5590c55a24f51386.webm?t=1759392903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/d7b70230775262df5590c55a24f51386.mp4?t=1759392903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feed Hungry \u201cCustomers\u201d!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hungry, aquatic customers of all shapes and sizes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/3c1b96590ad173b92cc3ea75f3127674.poster.avif?t=1759392903\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/3c1b96590ad173b92cc3ea75f3127674.webm?t=1759392903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/3c1b96590ad173b92cc3ea75f3127674.mp4?t=1759392903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Gear!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrading your gear allows you to fish for longer, catch more fish, and scale fish more efficiently!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/5f3e3debd8ee80567893d3ca52e41f37.poster.avif?t=1759392903\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/5f3e3debd8ee80567893d3ca52e41f37.webm?t=1759392903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/extras/5f3e3debd8ee80567893d3ca52e41f37.mp4?t=1759392903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3198890?t=1759392903","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198890/d2211a559f83c5db2cce57507a812641c1021fcf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759392903","capsul